| `design` | good at UI/UX, layouts, visual design |
| `reasoning` | strong at multi-step thinking/analysis |
| `research` | deep research / long investigation |
| `math` | mathematical and analytical tasks |
| `agentic` | tool calling, computer use, autonomous flows |
| `embedding` | embeddings for search/RAG |
| `translation` | translation and transcription |
| `fast` | low latency / cheap, good for simple tasks |

